  "note": "A see-through blueprint hologram (designer, 2026-10-04): the whole cue is half-transparent electric-blue light with blueprint linework over it (cross-section circles, longitudinal lines, grids, dimension lines, small schematic marks, the brightest lines white-hot), magenta neon rings at the joint and the butt collar and a glowing magenta hologram tip and blue ferrule (part-transparent too, the designer at gate 1). The surface is an OpenAI panel per zone turned into a hologram (the colour map's alpha: body about 0.5, lines opaque), a strong blue emissive, magenta rings in the emissive, AlphaMode Transparency. The 3D piece (pieces/beta): a slowly turning Neon wireframe lattice shell round the body, magenta rings (tori) at the joint and collar, a scan ring travelling tip to butt, and eight blueprint panels floating well beyond the cue at several radii and tilts (thin tinted panes with glyph strings and diagrams, Neon frames, leader lines to the cue), orbiting slowly with the aura.",
