      "size": "1536x768",
      "prompt": "A translucent hologram surface: very dark navy-black (#07102A) glass covered in glowing electric-blue (#1E6BFF) blueprint linework: thin straight longitudinal construction lines running left to right, evenly spaced thin cross-section ellipses drawn as if looking at rings on a cylinder, a faint fine grid, small dimension ticks and arrows, tiny schematic marks, and a few of the lines white-hot (#FFFFFF). A clean technical CAD wireframe look: thin crisp glowing lines on a dark see-through body, nothing solid, no shading. No text, no letters, no numbers, no logos."
